---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Little Slate House — Self-catering in Keswick town centre, Lake District"
  description="Three-bedroom Victorian cottage in the heart of Keswick. Sleeps 6. Two minutes from the high street, one from Fitz Park, with fell views. Self-catering in the Lake District."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-slate-800 text-white overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-700 opacity-90"></div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center opacity-30"
      style="background-image: url('/images/PRO-01.jpg')"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Front of Little Slate House, a Victorian stone cottage in Keswick"
    ></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:py-40">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
          Keswick · Lake District · Cumbria
        </p>
        <h1 id="hero-heading" class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
          Little Slate House
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-slate-200 font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Three bedrooms in the heart of town.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-xl">
          A Victorian cottage two minutes from Market Square, one minute from Fitz Park,
          and within easy reach of Derwentwater, Catbells, and the walks of Borrowdale.
          Sleeps 6. No fuss.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a
            href="/availability/"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-white text-slate-800 font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-slate-800"
          >
            Check dates &amp; enquire
          </a>
          <a
            href="/the-house/"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 border border-slate-400 text-white font-medium rounded-md hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-slate-800"
          >
            About the house
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key facts strip -->
  <section class="bg-stone-100 border-y border-stone-200" aria-label="Key property facts">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6">
      <ul class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4 sm:gap-8 sm:justify-center text-sm text-stone-700">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 7v10a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-6l-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2z" />
          </svg>
          <span><strong class="text-stone-900">3 bedrooms</strong> &middot; sleeps 6</span>
        </li>
        <li class="hidden sm:block text-stone-300" aria-hidden="true">|</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Keswick <strong class="text-stone-900">town centre</strong></span>
        </li>
        <li class="hidden sm:block text-stone-300" aria-hidden="true">|</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
          <span><strong class="text-stone-900">2 min</strong> high street &middot; <strong class="text-stone-900">1 min</strong> Fitz Park</span>
        </li>
        <li class="hidden sm:block text-stone-300" aria-hidden="true">|</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Fell views &middot; wood burner &middot; boot room</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What is it -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 id="about-heading" class="text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-6">
            A house made for the Lake District
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Little Slate House is a three-bedroom Victorian cottage on a quiet residential
              street in Keswick — which means you step out of the front door and you're already
              in town. Market Square and the Moot Hall are two minutes' walk. Fitz Park and
              the River Greta are one.
            </p>
            <p>
              The house sleeps six across three proper bedrooms: a king-size double, a double,
              and a third room that can be made up as twin singles or pushed together as a
              super-king. The sitting room has a wood-burning stove. There's a boot room with
              drying space — an essential rather than a luxury when you're coming back from
              Blencathra in November.
            </p>
            <p>
              Derwentwater is twelve minutes' walk, the Keswick Launch boats leave from the
              north shore, and the path to Catbells starts across the lake at Hawse End.
              Latrigg is walkable from the edge of town. Borrowdale opens up four miles south.
              The house makes a good base whether you're here for the fells, the lake, or simply
              a few days in one of the better small towns in England.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
            <a
              href="/the-house/"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 bg-slate-700 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-md hover:bg-slate-600 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-500 focus:ring-offset-2"
            >
              See the house in detail
            </a>
            <a
              href="/keswick/"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 border border-stone-300 text-stone-700 text-sm font-medium rounded-md hover:bg-stone-50 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-500 focus:ring-offset-2"
            >
              Keswick &amp; the area
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Image grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3" aria-label="Photos of Little Slate House">
          <div class="col-span-2">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-stone-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative flex items-center justify-center">
              <img
                src="/images/PRO-03.jpg"
                alt="Sitting room with wood-burning stove at Little Slate House"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-stone-200 rounded-xl flex-col gap-1 [&:has(+img)]:hidden" style="display:none;">
                <span class="text-stone-400 text-xs font-mono">PRO-03.jpg</span>
                <span class="text-stone-400 text-xs">Sitting room &middot; photo coming soon</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="aspect-square bg-stone-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
            <img
              src="/images/PRO-07.jpg"
              alt="Main bedroom at Little Slate House"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="aspect-square bg-stone-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
            <img
              src="/images/FAM-01.jpg"
              alt="Derwentwater from the Keswick shore"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Feel of the place -->
  <section class="bg-slate-800 text-white py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="feel-heading">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 id="feel-heading" class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">
          Why Keswick, and why this house
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5">
          People come to the Lake District and head straight for Windermere. Which is fine —
          but Keswick sits at the foot of Skiddaw, right between Derwentwater and the northern
          fells, with access to Borrowdale and Honister to the south and Blencathra to the east.
          It's a proper walking town with a good butcher, a decent farmers' market, and enough
          good cafes and pubs to make a rest day feel worthwhile.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          The house is in town because we think being in town matters. You don't need a car
          to get a coffee in the morning or walk to the lake after dinner. Castlerigg Stone
          Circle is twenty minutes on foot. The walks start from the doorstep.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/availability/"
          class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-white text-slate-800 font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-slate-800"
        >
          Enquire about your dates
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- At a glance -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-stone-50" aria-labelledby="highlights-heading">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 id="highlights-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-10 text-center">
        At a glance
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-stone-200">
          <div class="h-10 w-10 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 7v10a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-6l-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-2">Three bedrooms</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">King double, double, and a twin/super-king. Sleeps up to 6.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-stone-200">
          <div class="h-10 w-10 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-2">Town centre</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Shops, cafes, and the lake all within ten minutes on foot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-stone-200">
          <div class="h-10 w-10 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-2">Sleeps 6</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Comfortable for two families, a group of friends, or an extended family.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-stone-200">
          <div class="h-10 w-10 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-slate-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 18.657A8 8 0 016.343 7.343S7 9 9 10c0-2 .5-5 2.986-7C14 5 16.09 5.777 17.656 7.343A7.975 7.975 0 0120 13a7.975 7.975 0 01-2.343 5.657z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.879 16.121A3 3 0 1012.015 11L11 14H9c0 .768.293 1.536.879 2.121z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-2">Wood burner</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">A good sitting room with a working stove for autumn and winter stays.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Area teaser -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="area-teaser-heading">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 id="area-teaser-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3">
        From the doorstep
      </h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 mb-10 max-w-xl">
        A few of the places you can reach easily from Keswick.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <article>
          <div class="aspect-video bg-stone-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 flex items-center justify-center">
            <img
              src="/images/FAM-02.jpg"
              alt="Catbells ridge walk above Derwentwater"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">4 miles from town</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-1">Catbells</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">The classic Keswick ridge walk. Derwentwater below, Borrowdale beyond, Skiddaw behind you.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="aspect-video bg-stone-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 flex items-center justify-center">
            <img
              src="/images/FAM-01.jpg"
              alt="Derwentwater from the Keswick shore"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">10 min walk</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-1">Derwentwater</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Boat trips, shoreline walks, and the launch to Borrowdale on a good day.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="aspect-video bg-stone-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 flex items-center justify-center">
            <img
              src="/images/FAM-05.jpg"
              alt="Castlerigg Stone Circle with fell panorama"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">20 min walk</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-1">Castlerigg</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Neolithic stone circle on a fell-top platform with a 360-degree view of the surrounding summits.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a
          href="/keswick/"
          class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors"
        >
          More about Keswick and the area
          <svg class="ml-1 h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="bg-stone-100 border-t border-stone-200 py-14" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 id="cta-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3">
        Ready to plan your stay?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Send us your dates and we'll come back with availability and rates.
        Bookings are enquiry-led — no instant-book pressure.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/availability/"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-slate-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-slate-600 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-500 focus:ring-offset-2"
      >
        Check dates &amp; enquire
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
